WEBVTT

NOTE Narration is displayed in the caption strip below the video by default.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.989
Our fictional assistant may read supplied notes, draft a reply, and flag missing details.

00:00:04.989 --> 00:00:08.196
It may not send, book, change balances, or refund.

00:00:08.196 --> 00:00:10.334
The accounts coordinator checks every draft.

00:00:10.334 --> 00:00:14.966
Missing or contradictory information stops the path and returns it to that person.

00:00:14.966 --> 00:00:18.886
Actual tool access must match the written limits before any adoption.
